"""PTE Listening Bank 3: Listening Fill in the Blanks (50 items)
Canonical type_id: 'pte-listening-fib'
Live type_name: 'Listening Fill in the Blanks'

Each recording is written once with its three gaps in braces, e.g. "{microscope}".
The displayed passage replaces them with [[b1]]..[[b3]]; the recording keeps the words.
"""
